[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634795873","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102420#issuecomment-2634795873","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102420","id":2634795873,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dC8th","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T18:49:57Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T18:49:57Z","body":"For the record, this was added in #99700 and there was a question on whether it should be exposed here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99700#discussion_r1875038969\r\nIt wasn't clear whether this was actually an API we want to commit to supporting as it's a bit of a hack.\r\n\r\nTo be sure we understand the scope of this change, do you have a use case for this, or is it causing actual issues in GDExtension that this isn't exposed (aside from not being able to use it)?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634795873/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635756088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102420#issuecomment-2635756088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102420","id":2635756088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dGnI4","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T05:45:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T05:47:32Z","body":"Hi @akien-mga understood.  \r\n\r\nBut with this not defined in GDExtension's enum, this at least creates a weird situation where if some extension code uses or interacts with `ArrayMesh` and its properties, the hint is unknown. If you would rather it not be documented in `@GlobalScope.xml`, I think that's okay, but I do believe we need to at least have parity between the engine enum and the enum in `godot-cpp`, even if the hint is a hack and perhaps temporary.\r\n\r\nThe other thing I need to look at in our script editor implementation is if we do any type of loops over the property hints and whether having a gap in the enum will create any rendering issues for drop down options for functions that accept a `PropertyHint` enum argument type.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635756088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2636395431","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102420#issuecomment-2636395431","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102420","id":2636395431,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dJDOn","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T10:53:53Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T11:28:09Z","body":"Just to be clear, I'm not against exposing this if it solves issues. The only reluctance is that once it's exposed, it's part of the API we have to support and we can't break compatibility for it, so that's why we want to make sure we're willing to support this for all the Godot 4.x lifetime.\r\n\r\n> But with this not defined in GDExtension's enum, this at least creates a weird situation where if some extension code uses or interacts with `ArrayMesh` and its properties, the hint is unknown. If you would rather it not be documented in `@GlobalScope.xml`, I think that's okay, but I do believe we need to at least have parity between the engine enum and the enum in `godot-cpp`, even if the hint is a hack and perhaps temporary.\r\n\r\nWould you have a concrete example of how that looks like when you try to use ArrayMesh in godot-cpp? I don't find any property hint information in `extension_api.json` for properties that have hints in upstream Godot, so I'm not sure how this is surfaced to GDExtension.\r\n\r\nI also notice that `PROPERTY_HINT_LAYERS_AVOIDANCE` isn't exposed either. It's used by Navigation nodes `avoidance_layers`/`avoidance_mask` properties, do those also then trigger a problem on the extension side?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2636395431/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3184407838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102420#issuecomment-3184407838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102420","id":3184407838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69zjUe","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-13T15:31:57Z","updated_at":"2025-08-13T15:31:57Z","body":"We discussed this in the core meeting today. There is no consensus on whether `PROPERTY_HINT_NO_NODEPATH` is a temporary hack or something that should be used more widely. But also it doesn't seem very necessary for it to be exposed generally to users. \r\n\r\nOn the point of GDExtension parity between enums is not a requirement. In fact, any consumers of GDExtension should be able to handle cases where they find unexpected bits in bitmasks (for example) because an extension compiled for an older version of Godot may be used with a newer version of Godot which adds more items to the enum.\r\n\r\nTherefore, we don't think this needs to be merged until we have a decision on whether end users should be using `PROPERTY_HINT_NO_NODEPATH` which right now seems unlikely. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3184407838/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3184432729","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102420#issuecomment-3184432729","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102420","id":3184432729,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69zpZZ","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-13T15:38:22Z","updated_at":"2025-08-13T15:38:22Z","body":"Thanks for the update @clayjohn. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3184432729/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3570025869","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102420#issuecomment-3570025869","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102420","id":3570025869,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UykWN","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T10:32:18Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T10:32:18Z","body":"I went ahead and rebased in case you change your mind @clayjohn.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3570025869/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]